THE MODIFICATION (2026-10-15)
-----------------------------
Added: a platform-level API endpoint that creates a tenant workspace
programmatically, plus the identity that owns such workspaces.

Reason: upstream Relaticle creates workspaces only through its Filament
registration UI (App\Filament\Pages\CreateWorkspace) or the `demo:reset`
artisan command. There is no REST route, console command or other programmatic
path — `php artisan route:list --path=api/v1` shows 34 routes and none of them
creates a workspace, and API tokens can only be minted from an in-app settings
page that itself requires a workspace and a signed-in user. An external
orchestrator therefore cannot provision a tenant end to end. That gap is the
entire reason for this fork.

